-- title:
--   Mutual integrality of j and j(mathsf q^q) in the level-H₁ field
-- statement:
--   Let $q$ be a prime, $M'$ a nonzero natural number with $q \nmid M'$, and $\ell_g$ a prime dividing $M'$; let $L$ be a field of characteristic zero. Let $H_1$ be the subgroup of $(\mathbb{Z}/q^2M')^\times$ given by the intersection of [`ModularCurve.FullLevel.levelH q M'`](def/ModularCurve_FullLevelJacobian.html#L22), the kernel of the reduction $(\mathbb{Z}/q^2M')^\times \to (\mathbb{Z}/q)^\times$, with the kernel of the reduction $(\mathbb{Z}/q^2M')^\times \to (\mathbb{Z}/\ell_g)^\times$. Let $K$ be the intermediate field of $L \subseteq \mathrm{LaurentSeries}\,L$ obtained as `laurentBaseChange`, i.e. the $L$-subfield generated by the image of [`ModularCurve.xHFunctionField (q ^ 2 * M') H₁`](def/ModularCurve_XH.html#L79) (the field of $q$-expansions attached to $\Gamma_{H_1}$ of level $q^2M'$) under the coefficientwise map `coeffEmb L` induced by $\mathbb{Q} \to L$. Let $A$ be a commutative ring with algebra structures on $L$ and on $K$ forming a scalar tower. The conclusion asserts: the series `coeffEmb L jq` (the $q$-expansion $\mathsf q^{-1}+\dots$ of the modular invariant, pushed to $L$) lies in $K$ and is nonzero there; the series `qExpand L q (coeffEmb L jq)`, obtained by the substitution $\mathsf q \mapsto \mathsf q^{q}$ on exponents, lies in $K$ and is nonzero there; and, as elements of $K$, each of the two is integral over the $A$-subalgebra of $K$ generated by the other, i.e. each lies in `chartAlgFin A K` of the other.
--
--   This records the two generators $j$ and $j(\mathsf q^q)$ of the level-$H_1$ function field together with the classical modular equation $\Phi_q(j, j(\mathsf q^q)) = 0$ in the form needed to identify the affine charts of the two-chart integral model: the integral closures of $A[j]$ and of $A[j(\mathsf q^q)]$ in $K$ coincide. It is used downstream in the computations of stalks and of the action of level automorphisms on the Drinfeld chart of that model.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_FullLevel_Diamond_coeffEmb_jq_mem_and_qExpand_mem_and_mem_chartAlgFin_xHFunctionField.lean

